  "changes": {
    "mouseManager::Close": "Early inactive return and explicit saved-bitmap null guard before delete; retain both HoMM1 delays and both bitmap-mask cleanup paths.",
    "mouseManager::SetPointer": "Separate negative-frame and inactive guards; frame-before-offset addition; unsigned cursor pixel loads at retail offsets 0x2c1, 0x329, 0x39d and 0x40e.",
    "cColorBits": "Retype pointees from signed i8 to unsigned u8. Owner storage RVA 0xcf1e0 and 75 pointer elements are unchanged. Canonical data-symbol spelling and layout facts follow the recovered type. ReadBlock retains its signed-byte API, with an explicit pointer conversion at the two reads.",
    "heroWindow resource constructor": "Chained null assignments and compound flag OR; use donor idx, pButton, pIcon, pText and pTextEnt names and corresponding declaration order. HoMM1 widget cases and field widths are retained.",
    "KeyboardMessageHandler": "Restore VK_RETURN to INPUT_SCAN_ENTER normalization on both WM_KEYDOWN and WM_KEYUP. Restore donor modifier case order: Control, Alt, left Shift, right Shift.",
    "inputManager::Open": "Retain the retail signed 16-bit positive-option local, initialized to one and passed to SetPositiveOption. G5 emits the observed partial-register argument load without an added xor.",
    "border::Read": "Mask the ReadWord result directly into fill color before clearing the background pointer.",
    "textEntryWidget::Draw": "Donor len local spelling and owner-before-widget horizontal-coordinate sums. No change to HoMM1 draw arguments or base-class draw call."
  },
